# "Discard three cards at random" with fewer than three cards in hand discards the whole hand (CR 701.9). Bot1 plays out its free Ornithopters, casts Casey Jones on
# turn 5 and draws Ornithopter, Mountain, Mountain; it casts the Ornithopter and keeps two Mountains. At the upkeep on turn 7 both Mountains are discarded and nothing more
# is asked or lost; the draw step then draws an Island.

